        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1953-05-26/pdf/FR-1953-05-26.pdf"
      },
      "text": "By virtue of the authority vested in me \nby sections 55 (a ), 508, 603, 729 (a ), and \n1204 of the Internal Revenue Code C 5 3 \nStat. 29, 111, 171; 54 Stat. 989, 1008; 55 \nStat. 722; 26 ü. S. C. 55 (a ), 508, 603, 729\n(a), and 1204)-, it is hereby ordered that  \nany income, excess-profits, declared  \nvalue excess-profits, capital stock,  \nestate, or gift tax return for any period  \nto and including 1952, shall, during  \nthe Eighty-third Congress, be open to  \ninspection by the Committee on Gov­\nernment Operations, House of Rep­\nresentatives, or any duly authorized  \nsubcommittee thereof in connection with \nits studies of the operation of Govern­\nment activities at all levels with a view to \ndetermining its economy and efficiency,  \nsubject to the conditions stated in the  \nTreasury decision1  relating to the in­\nspection of such returns by that Com­\nmittee, approved by me this date.\nThis Executive order shall be effective  \nupon its filing for publication in the  \nFederal R egister ."
    }
  ],
